[00:16.66]Love slips away before you barely know its there
[00:24.99]No-one taps your shoulder as it circles round the drain
[00:32.28]Time will pass you by and you will wonder where it went
[00:41.64]Playing back the memories in your head
[00:49.26]Life finds a way to always pass me by
[00:58.22]I fall on my face and never realize its gone,
[01:08.47]Its gone, it left long ago
[01:17.02]Why have eyes if i refuse to see
[01:22.99]The ground where i stand's crumbling neat my feet
[01:29.52]And if i ever recognize my lifeboat's going to sink
[01:40.17]Instead of trying to patch the holes i watch it drift beneath
